ring r=0,(c1,c2,c3,c4,c5,c6,c7,c8,c9,c10,c11,cb1,cb2,cb3,cb4,cb5,cb6,cb7,cb8,cb9,cb10,cb11),dp;
option(redSB);
LIB "primdec.lib";
map sg=r,cb1,cb2,cb3,cb4,cb5,cb6,cb7,cb8,cb9,cb10,cb11,c1,c2,c3,c4,c5,c6,c7,c8,c9,c10,c11;
ideal I=-3*c10*cb9 - c11*cb8 + c8*cb11 + 3*c9*cb10,-c1*cb10 + c2*cb7,-c1*cb2 + c10*cb7 + c2*cb1 - c3*cb5 - c3*cb6 - c4*cb8 + c5*cb3 + c5*cb9 + c6*cb3 - c6*cb9 - c7*cb10 + c8*cb4 - c9*cb5 + c9*cb6,-c1*cb4 + c2*cb8 - c3*cb9 + c4*cb1 + c5*cb6 - c6*cb5 - c8*cb2 + c9*cb3,-c1*cb5 + c2*cb3 + c2*cb9 - c3*cb10 + c4*cb6 + c5*cb7,-c1*cb6 + c2*cb3 - c2*cb9 - c3*cb10 - c4*cb5 + c6*cb7,-c1*cb8 - 3*c2*cb4 + 3*c4*cb2 + c8*cb1,-c1*cb9 - c2*cb5 + c2*cb6 + c4*cb3,-c10*cb1 + c7*cb2,-c10*cb11 + c11*cb10 - c2*cb3 + c3*cb2 - c4*cb5 + c4*cb6 + c5*cb4 - c5*cb7 - c6*cb4 - c6*cb7 + c7*cb5 + c7*cb6 - c8*cb9 + c9*cb8,-c10*cb2 + c5*cb5 - c7*cb4 + c9*cb3,-c10*cb2 + c6*cb6 + c7*cb4 - c9*cb3,-c10*cb3 + c11*cb2,-c10*cb3 + c3*cb2 - c5*cb1 + c6*cb4 + c7*cb5 + c9*cb2,-c10*cb3 + c3*cb2 - c5*cb4 - c6*cb1 + c7*cb6 - c9*cb2,-c10*cb4 + c10*cb7 - c11*cb5 + c5*cb3 - c7*cb2 - c9*cb6,-c10*cb4 + c4*cb10 - c5*cb9 - c6*cb9 - c7*cb8 + c8*cb7 + c9*cb5 + c9*cb6,-c10*cb4 - c10*cb7 + c11*cb6 - c6*cb3 + c7*cb2 - c9*cb5,-c10*cb5 + c10*cb6 + c11*cb4 - c9*cb7,-c10*cb5 + c2*cb5 - c3*cb4 + c4*cb3 - c4*cb9 + c5*cb10 - c5*cb2 + c6*cb8 - c7*cb9 - c8*cb6 + c9*cb4 + c9*cb7,-c10*cb6 + c2*cb6 + c3*cb4 - c4*cb3 - c4*cb9 - c5*cb8 + c6*cb10 - c6*cb2 + c7*cb9 + c8*cb5 + c9*cb4 - c9*cb7,-c10*cb8 + c11*cb9 - c4*cb7 + c5*cb6 - c6*cb5 + c7*cb4 + c8*cb10 - c9*cb11,-c2*cb10 + c3*cb9 - c4*cb7 + c5*cb5,-c2*cb10 - c3*cb9 + c4*cb7 + c6*cb6,-c2*cb11 + c3*cb10,-c2*cb7 + c3*cb5 - c4*cb10 - c5*cb11 - c6*cb9 + c7*cb10,-c2*cb7 + c3*cb6 + c4*cb10 + c5*cb9 - c6*cb11 + c7*cb10,-c2*cb9 - c3*cb8 + c4*cb5 + c4*cb6 - c5*cb4 - c6*cb4 + c8*cb3 + c9*cb2,-c3*cb4 + c5*cb2 - c6*cb2 + c9*cb1,-c3*cb5 + c5*cb3,-c3*cb6 + c6*cb3,-c4*cb11 + c5*cb10 - c6*cb10 + c7*cb9,-c5*cb7 + c7*cb5,-c6*cb7 + c7*cb6,3*c10*cb9 + c11*cb8 - c8*cb11 - 3*c9*cb10,c1*cb1 + 3*c10*cb10 + c11*cb11 + 3*c2*cb2 + 3*c3*cb3 + 3*c4*cb4 + 3*c5*cb5 + 3*c6*cb6 + 3*c7*cb7 + c8*cb8 + 3*c9*cb9 - 1,c1*cb10 - c2*cb7,c1*cb11,c1*cb2 - c10*cb7 - c2*cb1 + c3*cb5 + c3*cb6 + c4*cb8 - c5*cb3 - c5*cb9 - c6*cb3 + c6*cb9 + c7*cb10 - c8*cb4 + c9*cb5 - c9*cb6,c1*cb3 + c2*cb5 + c2*cb6 + 2*c3*cb7 + c4*cb9 + c5*cb10 + c6*cb10 + c7*cb11,c1*cb4 - c2*cb8 + c3*cb9 - c4*cb1 - c5*cb6 + c6*cb5 + c8*cb2 - c9*cb3,c1*cb5 - c2*cb3 - c2*cb9 + c3*cb10 - c4*cb6 - c5*cb7,c1*cb6 - c2*cb3 + c2*cb9 + c3*cb10 + c4*cb5 - c6*cb7,c1*cb7 + c2*cb10 + c3*cb11,c1*cb8 + 3*c2*cb4 - 3*c4*cb2 - c8*cb1,c1*cb9 + c2*cb5 - c2*cb6 - c4*cb3,c10*cb1 - c7*cb2,c10*cb11 - c11*cb10 + c2*cb3 - c3*cb2 + c4*cb5 - c4*cb6 - c5*cb4 + c5*cb7 + c6*cb4 + c6*cb7 - c7*cb5 - c7*cb6 + c8*cb9 - c9*cb8,c10*cb2 + c11*cb3 + c7*cb1,c10*cb2 - c5*cb5 + c7*cb4 - c9*cb3,c10*cb2 - c6*cb6 - c7*cb4 + c9*cb3,c10*cb3 - c11*cb2,c10*cb3 - c3*cb2 + c5*cb1 - c6*cb4 - c7*cb5 - c9*cb2,c10*cb3 - c3*cb2 + c5*cb4 + c6*cb1 - c7*cb6 + c9*cb2,c10*cb4 + c10*cb7 - c11*cb6 + c6*cb3 - c7*cb2 + c9*cb5,c10*cb4 - c10*cb7 + c11*cb5 - c5*cb3 + c7*cb2 + c9*cb6,c10*cb4 - c4*cb10 + c5*cb9 + c6*cb9 + c7*cb8 - c8*cb7 - c9*cb5 - c9*cb6,c10*cb5 + c10*cb6 + c11*cb7 + c3*cb1 + c5*cb2 + c6*cb2 + 2*c7*cb3 + c9*cb4,c10*cb5 - c10*cb6 - c11*cb4 + c9*cb7,c10*cb5 - c2*cb5 + c3*cb4 - c4*cb3 + c4*cb9 - c5*cb10 + c5*cb2 - c6*cb8 + c7*cb9 + c8*cb6 - c9*cb4 - c9*cb7,c10*cb6 - c2*cb6 - c3*cb4 + c4*cb3 + c4*cb9 + c5*cb8 - c6*cb10 + c6*cb2 - c7*cb9 - c8*cb5 - c9*cb4 + c9*cb7,c10*cb8 - c11*cb9 + c4*cb7 - c5*cb6 + c6*cb5 - c7*cb4 - c8*cb10 + c9*cb11,c11*cb1,c2*cb10 + c3*cb9 - c4*cb7 - c6*cb6,c2*cb10 - c3*cb9 + c4*cb7 - c5*cb5,c2*cb11 - c3*cb10,c2*cb7 - c3*cb5 + c4*cb10 + c5*cb11 + c6*cb9 - c7*cb10,c2*cb7 - c3*cb6 - c4*cb10 - c5*cb9 + c6*cb11 - c7*cb10,c2*cb9 + c3*cb8 - c4*cb5 - c4*cb6 + c5*cb4 + c6*cb4 - c8*cb3 - c9*cb2,c3*cb3 + c5*cb6 + c7*cb7,c3*cb3 + c6*cb5 + c7*cb7,c3*cb4 - c5*cb2 + c6*cb2 - c9*cb1,c3*cb5 - c5*cb3,c3*cb6 - c6*cb3,c3*cb7,c4*cb11 - c5*cb10 + c6*cb10 - c7*cb9,c5*cb7 - c7*cb5,c6*cb7 - c7*cb6,c7*cb3;
list L=minAssGTZ(I);
list todo=L; list stable;
int i,j,k,isnew; ideal Q,S,T;
while(size(todo)>0){
  Q=std(todo[1]); todo=delete(todo,1);
  S=std(sg(Q));
  if(size(reduce(S,Q))==0 && size(reduce(Q,S))==0){
    isnew=1;
    for(j=1;j<=size(stable);j++){ if(size(reduce(stable[j],Q))==0 && size(reduce(Q,stable[j]))==0){isnew=0;} }
    if(isnew){stable=insert(stable,Q,size(stable));}
  } else {
    T=Q+S;
    if(dim(std(T))>=0){
      list M=minAssGTZ(T);
      for(k=1;k<=size(M);k++){todo=insert(todo,std(M[k]));}
      kill M;
    }
  }
}
// remove non-minimal among stable
list fin;
for(i=1;i<=size(stable);i++){
  isnew=1;
  for(j=1;j<=size(stable);j++){ if(i!=j){ if(size(reduce(stable[j],stable[i]))==0 && size(reduce(stable[i],stable[j]))!=0){isnew=0;} } }
  if(isnew){fin=insert(fin,stable[i],size(fin));}
}
"number of sigma-stable primes:"; size(fin);
for(i=1;i<=size(fin);i++){ "SPRIME",i; "dim",dim(fin[i]); fin[i]; }
write(":w model_stable.ssi","");
link l="ssi:w model_stable.ssi"; write(l,fin); close(l);
quit;
